Emerging Market Opportunities
The growing emphasis on grid resilience creates opportunities for advanced multimodal sensing technologies and integrated monitoring platforms. Solutions combining vibration, acoustic, electrical, and environmental measurements can provide utilities with a more comprehensive view of pole and distribution-line conditions.

Additional opportunities exist in predictive analytics, telemetry integration, remote diagnostics, and recurring monitoring subscriptions. Providers that offer reliable installation, commissioning, data integration, and ongoing technical support may benefit as utilities expand deployments in stages.

